  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "With the new profile layout you can no longer quick swap pronouns. On the current non beta version you can open your profile, click on your pronouns and it opens up your pronouns menu to swap them. Now on the beta the only way to do this is to open your profile, click on edit profile, scroll all the way down and click edit pronouns just to get the same window to come up. You can't just click on pronouns in profile any more. \n\nIts very convoluted to have to do this every time we want to change pronouns and is absolutely a regression in feature so I do not think it is intended seeing as its an accessibility issue for DID/plural folks to add 2 more annoying steps to a process.",
